                            </h1>
                            <p class="bento-hero-desc">
                                Hệ thống phân phối vợt công thủ toàn diện cao cấp, giày thi đấu bám sân Power Cushion và trang phục chính hãng Yonex, Victor, Li-Ning chuẩn bảo hành.
                            </p>
                            <div class="d-flex gap-3 flex-wrap mb-4">
                                <a class="btn hero-btn-gold rounded-pill px-4 py-3 fw-bold shadow-lg" href="/Danh-Muc">
                                    <i class="bi bi-bag-check-fill me-2"></i>Khám phá bộ sưu tập
                                    <i class="bi bi-arrow-right ms-1"></i>
                                </a>
                                <a class="btn btn-outline-light rounded-pill px-4 py-3 fw-bold hero-btn-glass" href="/Tu-Van-Chon-Vot">
                                    <i class="bi bi-cpu-fill text-info me-2"></i>Chọn vợt AI
                                </a>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Right Interactive Emblem Showcase inside Hero (Desktop XL+) -->
                        <div class="col-xl-5 d-none d-xl-flex justify-content-center align-items-center">
                            <div class="hero-crest-stage">
                                <div class="hero-crest-glow"></div>
                                <div class="hero-crest-ring">
                                    <img src="~/img/tobuon-logo.jpg" alt="Tổ Buôn Badminton Official Crest" class="hero-crest-img" />
                                </div>
                                <div class="hero-float-chip chip-top">
                                    <i class="bi bi-shield-fill-check text-success"></i>
                                    <span>100% Chính Hãng</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="hero-float-chip chip-bottom">
                                    <i class="bi bi-lightning-charge-fill text-warning"></i>
                                    <span>Căng 4 Nút BWF</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Stats Row -->
                    <div class="bento-stats-row position-relative" style="z-index: 2;">
                        <div class="stat-pill">
                            <span class="stat-number">10K+</span>
                            <div class="stat-label">Tay vợt<br />tin dùng</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="stat-pill">
                            <span class="stat-number">100%</span>
                            <div class="stat-label">Chính hãng<br />tem bảo hành</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="stat-pill">
                            <span class="stat-number">4.9 <i class="bi bi-star-fill text-warning"></i></span>
                            <div class="stat-label">Đánh giá<br />(2,500+ vote)</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="stat-pill d-none d-sm-flex">
                            <span class="stat-number text-warning">15p</span>
                            <div class="stat-label">Căng điện tử<br />4 nút lấy liền</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Right 2 Sub Bento Cards -->
            <div class="col-lg-5 col-xl-4 bento-side-col">
                <!-- Sub Card 1: Vợt Công Kích -->
                <a href="/Danh-Muc?cat=vot" class="bento-card-sub bento-card-crimson text-decoration-none">
                    <div class="bento-sub-info">
                        <span class="badge bg-danger bg-opacity-10 text-danger border border-danger border-opacity-25 fw-bold px-2 py-1 mb-2 rounded-pill">
                            <i class="bi bi-fire me-1"></i>HOT TREND
                        </span>
                        <h4 class="fw-bold mb-1 text-dark fs-5">Vợt Công Kích Tốc Độ</h4>
                        <p class="text-muted small mb-3">Tùy chọn 3U/4U &amp; màu sắc thực tế</p>
                        <span class="bento-sub-cta text-danger">
                            Xem bộ sưu tập <i class="bi bi-arrow-right ms-1"></i>
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <img src="~/img/banners/banner1.jfif" class="bento-sub-img" alt="Vợt cầu lông" />
                </a>

                <!-- Sub Card 2: Giày Bám Sân -->
                <a href="/Danh-Muc?cat=giay" class="bento-card-sub bento-card-emerald text-decoration-none">
                    <div class="bento-sub-info">
                        <span class="badge bg-success bg-opacity-10 text-success border border-success border-opacity-25 fw-bold px-2 py-1 mb-2 rounded-pill">
                            <i class="bi bi-lightning-charge-fill me-1"></i>CUSHION PRO
                        </span>
                        <h4 class="fw-bold mb-1 text-dark fs-5">Giày Êm Bám Sân</h4>
                        <p class="text-muted small mb-3">Đế cao su tự nhiên, size 38–44 chuẩn</p>
                        <span class="bento-sub-cta text-success">
                            Khám phá ngay <i class="bi bi-arrow-right ms-1"></i>
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <img src="~/img/banners/banner2.jfif" class="bento-sub-img" alt="Giày cầu lông" />
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 2. QUICK CATEGORY CHIPS (APP-LIKE 1-TAP ACCESS) -->
    <section class="mb-5">
        <div class="category-chips-wrap">
            <a class="category-chip active" href="/Danh-Muc">
                <span class="chip-icon-circle bg-white bg-opacity-25"><i class="bi bi-grid-fill"></i></span>
                <span>Tất cả sản phẩm</span>
            </a>
            <a class="category-chip" href="/Danh-Muc?cat=vot">
                <span class="chip-icon-circle text-danger bg-danger bg-opacity-10"><i class="bi bi-trophy-fill"></i></span>
                <span>Vợt thi đấu Pro</span>
            </a>
            <a class="category-chip" href="/Danh-Muc?cat=giay">
                <span class="chip-icon-circle text-warning bg-warning bg-opacity-15"><i class="bi bi-lightning-fill"></i></span>
                <span>Giày bám sân</span>
            </a>
            <a class="category-chip" href="/Danh-Muc?cat=quan-ao">
                <span class="chip-icon-circle text-primary bg-primary bg-opacity-10"><i class="bi bi-handbag-fill"></i></span>
                <span>Trang phục</span>
            </a>
            <a class="category-chip" href="/Tu-Van-Chon-Vot">
                <span class="chip-icon-circle text-danger bg-danger bg-opacity-10"><i class="bi bi-cpu-fill"></i></span>
                <span class="fw-bold">Tư vấn vợt AI</span>
            </a>
            <a class="category-chip" href="/Dang-Ky-Khoa-Hoc">
                <span class="chip-icon-circle text-success bg-success bg-opacity-10"><i class="bi bi-mortarboard-fill"></i></span>
                <span class="fw-bold">Khóa học</span>
            </a>
            <a class="category-chip" href="/Bang-Xep-Hang">
                <span class="chip-icon-circle text-warning bg-warning bg-opacity-15"><i class="bi bi-award-fill"></i></span>
                <span class="fw-bold">BXH VĐV &amp; Vợt</span>
            </a>
            <a class="category-chip" href="/Dich-Vu-Cang-Cuoc">
                <span class="chip-icon-circle text-info bg-info bg-opacity-10"><i class="bi bi-tools"></i></span>
                <span>Căng cước 4 nút</span>
            </a>
            <a class="category-chip" href="/Tra-Cuu-Don-Hang">
                <span class="chip-icon-circle text-secondary bg-secondary bg-opacity-10"><i class="bi bi-box-seam-fill"></i></span>
                <span>Tra cứu đơn hàng</span>
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 3. FLASH SALE COUNTDOWN SECTION -->
    <section class="flash-sale-wrap">
        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center gap-3 mb-4 position-relative" style="z-index: 2;">
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center flex-wrap gap-3">
                <span class="flash-sale-badge"><i class="bi bi-lightning-charge-fill me-1"></i>FLASH SALE GIỜ VÀNG</span>
                <span class="text-light opacity-75 small d-none d-sm-inline">Ưu đãi đặc quyền Tổ Buôn • Kết thúc sau:</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Countdown Timer Boxes -->
            <div class="countdown-box">
                <div class="countdown-item">
                    <div id="cdHours" class="countdown-num">08</div>
                    <div class="countdown-unit">Giờ</div>
                </div>
                <span class="countdown-colon">:</span>
                <div class="countdown-item">
                    <div id="cdMins" class="countdown-num">24</div>
                    <div class="countdown-unit">Phút</div>
                </div>
                <span class="countdown-colon">:</span>
                <div class="countdown-item">
                    <div id="cdSecs" class="countdown-num">55</div>
                    <div class="countdown-unit">Giây</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 4 Flash Sale Products Highlight -->
        <div class="row g-3 g-md-4 position-relative" style="z-index: 2;">
            @foreach (var p in Model.BestSellers.Take(4))
            {
                var discountPercent = 0;
                if (p.SalePrice.HasValue && p.Price > 0 && p.SalePrice < p.Price)
                {
                    discountPercent = (int)Math.Round((1 - (p.SalePrice.Value / p.Price)) * 100);
                }
                else
                {
                    discountPercent = 15;
                }

                var isFav = wishlistIds.Contains(p.Id);
                var variantColors = (p.Variants ?? new List<tieudaobadminton.Models.ProductVariant>())
                    .Where(v => !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(v.Color) && v.Color != "-")
                    .Select(v => v.Color!.Trim())
                    .Distinct(StringComparer.OrdinalIgnoreCase)
                    .Take(4)
                    .ToList();
                var stockLeft = GetTotalStock(p);

                <div class="col-6 col-lg-3">
                    <div class="pro-card h-100">
                        <div class="pro-card-media">
                            <a asp-controller="Products" asp-action="Detail" asp-route-id="@p.Id" class="d-block w-100 h-100">
                                <img class="pro-card-img" src="@(p.MainImageUrl ?? "/img/demo/placeholder.jpg")" alt="@p.Name" loading="lazy" />
                            </a>
                            <div class="pro-card-badges">
                                <span class="badge-sale-pro"><i class="bi bi-lightning-charge-fill me-1"></i>GIẢM @discountPercent%</span>
                            </div>
                            <button type="button" class="pro-wishlist-btn @(isFav ? "active" : "")" onclick="toggleWishlist(@p.Id, this);" title="Yêu thích">
                                <i class="bi @(isFav ? "bi-heart-fill" : "bi-heart")"></i>
                            </button>
                            <div class="pro-quick-sizes">
                                <span>@GetVariantSummary(p)</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="pro-card-body">
                            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-1">
                                <span class="small fw-bold text-primary text-uppercase" style="font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">@(p.Brand?.Name ?? "CHÍNH HÃNG")</span>
                                @if (variantColors.Count > 0)
                                {
                                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-1" title="Nhiều phiên bản màu sắc">
                                        @foreach (var col in variantColors)
                                        {
                                            <span class="card-color-dot" style="background-color: @GetColorHexDot(col);"></span>
                                        }
                                    </div>
                                }
                            </div>
                            <a asp-controller="Products" asp-action="Detail" asp-route-id="@p.Id" class="text-decoration-none">
                                <h5 class="pro-card-title" title="@p.Name">@p.Name</h5>
                            </a>

                            <div class="pro-price-wrap mb-2">
                                <span class="pro-price-current is-sale">@((p.SalePrice ?? p.Price).ToString("n0")) đ</span>
                                <span class="pro-price-old">@((p.SalePrice.HasValue ? p.Price : p.Price * 1.15m).ToString("n0")) đ</span>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Stock Progress -->
                            <div class="stock-progress-wrap bg-danger bg-opacity-10">
                                <div class="stock-progress-bar" style="width: 82%;"></div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between text-muted" style="font-size: 0.72rem;">
                                <span>Đang mở bán</span>
                                <span class="text-danger fw-bold">@(stockLeft > 0 ? $"Còn {stockLeft} SP" : "Sắp về thêm")</span>
                            </div>

                            <a class="btn-pro-action mt-3" asp-controller="Products" asp-action="Detail" asp-route-id="@p.Id">
                                <span>Săn ngay</span>
                                <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            }
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 4. TOP BÁN CHẠY (PRODUCT CARDS 2.0 - BALANCED 4-COL GRID) -->
    <section class="mb-5">
        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-end gap-3 mb-4">
            <div>
                <span class="badge bg-primary bg-opacity-10 text-primary fw-bold px-3 py-1 mb-2 rounded-pill">
                    <i class="bi bi-trophy-fill me-1 text-warning"></i>BEST SELLERS 2026
                </span>
                <h2 class="fw-black mb-0 text-dark">Sản phẩm được các tay vợt tin dùng</h2>
            </div>
            <a class="btn btn-outline-dark btn-sm rounded-pill px-4 py-2 fw-bold" href="/Danh-Muc">
                Xem toàn bộ sản phẩm <i class="bi bi-arrow-right ms-1"></i>
            </a>
        </div>

        <div class="row g-3 g-md-4">
            @foreach (var p in Model.BestSellers.Skip(4).Take(8))
            {
                var discountPercent = 0;
                if (p.SalePrice.HasValue && p.Price > 0 && p.SalePrice < p.Price)
                {
                    discountPercent = (int)Math.Round((1 - (p.SalePrice.Value / p.Price)) * 100);
                }

                var isFav2 = wishlistIds.Contains(p.Id);
                var variantColors2 = (p.Variants ?? new List<tieudaobadminton.Models.ProductVariant>())
                    .Where(v => !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(v.Color) && v.Color != "-")
                    .Select(v => v.Color!.Trim())
                    .Distinct(StringComparer.OrdinalIgnoreCase)
                    .Take(4)
                    .ToList();

                <div class="col-6 col-md-4 col-lg-3">
                    <div class="pro-card h-100">
                        <!-- Media & Wishlist & Quick Sizes -->
                        <div class="pro-card-media">
                            <a asp-controller="Products" asp-action="Detail" asp-route-id="@p.Id" class="d-block w-100 h-100">
                                <img class="pro-card-img" src="@(p.MainImageUrl ?? "/img/demo/placeholder.jpg")" alt="@p.Name" loading="lazy" />
                            </a>

                            <div class="pro-card-badges">
                                @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(p.Brand?.Name))
                                {
                                    <span class="badge-brand-pro">@p.Brand.Name</span>
                                }
                                @if (discountPercent > 0)
                                {
                                    <span class="badge-sale-pro">-@discountPercent%</span>
                                }
                            </div>

                            <button type="button" class="pro-wishlist-btn @(isFav2 ? "active" : "")" onclick="toggleWishlist(@p.Id, this);" title="Yêu thích">
                                <i class="bi @(isFav2 ? "bi-heart-fill" : "bi-heart")"></i>
                            </button>

                            <div class="pro-quick-sizes">
                                <span>@GetVariantSummary(p)</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Body with Rating Stars & Color Swatches -->
                        <div class="pro-card-body">
                            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-1">
                                <div class="pro-rating-row mb-0">
                                    <span><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i></span>
                                    <span class="pro-rating-score">4.9</span>
                                    <span class="pro-rating-count">(86)</span>
                                </div>
                                @if (variantColors2.Count > 0)
                                {
                                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-1" title="Chọn màu sắc khi xem chi tiết">
                                        @foreach (var col in variantColors2)
                                        {
                                            <span class="card-color-dot" style="background-color: @GetColorHexDot(col);"></span>
                                        }
                                    </div>
                                }
                            </div>

                            <a asp-controller="Products" asp-action="Detail" asp-route-id="@p.Id" class="text-decoration-none">
                                <h5 class="pro-card-title" title="@p.Name">@p.Name</h5>
                            </a>

                            <div class="pro-price-wrap">
                                @if (p.SalePrice.HasValue)
                                {
                                    <span class="pro-price-current is-sale">@p.SalePrice.Value.ToString("n0") đ</span>
                                    <span class="pro-price-old">@p.Price.ToString("n0") đ</span>
                                }
                                else
                                {
                                    <span class="pro-price-current">@p.Price.ToString("n0") đ</span>
                                }
                            </div>

                            <a class="btn-pro-action" asp-controller="Products" asp-action="Detail" asp-route-id="@p.Id">
                                <span>Xem chi tiết</span>
                                <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            }
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 4.3. HỆ SINH THÁI ĐỘC QUYỀN: HỌC VIỆN ĐÀO TẠO & BẢNG XẾP HẠNG VĐV -->
    <section class="mb-5">
        <div class="row g-4">
            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <div class="spotlight-banner spotlight-academy h-100">
                    <div class="spotlight-content">
                        <span class="badge bg-warning text-dark fw-bold rounded-pill px-3 py-1 mb-3">
                            <i class="bi bi-mortarboard-fill me-1"></i>HỌC VIỆN TỔ BUÔN BADMINTON
                        </span>
                        <h3 class="fw-black text-white mb-2">Khóa Học Cầu Lông Cơ Bản &amp; Nâng Cao</h3>
                        <p class="text-light opacity-75 small mb-4" style="line-height: 1.7;">
                            Lộ trình 12 buổi bài bản chuẩn giáo trình BWF cùng HLV cấp Quốc gia. Miễn phí vợt tập carbon, sân thảm giảm chấn chuẩn quốc tế.
                        </p>
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center flex-wrap gap-3">
                            <a href="/Dang-Ky-Khoa-Hoc" class="btn btn-warning text-dark fw-bold rounded-pill px-4 py-2 shadow-sm">
                                Đăng ký khóa học <i class="bi bi-arrow-right ms-1"></i>
                            </a>
                            <span class="small text-white-50 fw-semibold">Chỉ từ 1.200.000đ / khóa</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <div class="spotlight-banner spotlight-ranking h-100">
                    <div class="spotlight-content">
                        <span class="badge bg-info text-dark fw-bold rounded-pill px-3 py-1 mb-3">
                            <i class="bi bi-award-fill me-1"></i>BWF &amp; VIETNAM PRO DATABASE
                        </span>
                        <h3 class="fw-black text-white mb-2">Bảng Xếp Hạng VĐV &amp; Hồ Sơ Vợt Thi Đấu</h3>
                        <p class="text-light opacity-75 small mb-4" style="line-height: 1.7;">
                            Khám phá Nguyễn Thùy Linh, Nguyễn Tiến Minh, Viktor Axelsen, Shi Yu Qi, Lin Dan, Lee Chong Wei từng dùng cây vợt nào &amp; mức căng bao nhiêu kg.
                        </p>
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center flex-wrap gap-3">
                            <a href="/Bang-Xep-Hang" class="btn btn-light text-dark fw-bold rounded-pill px-4 py-2 shadow-sm">
                                Tra cứu BXH VĐV <i class="bi bi-arrow-right ms-1"></i>
                            </a>
                            <span class="small text-white-50 fw-semibold">16+ Hồ sơ tuyển thủ &amp; huyền thoại</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 4.5. TIỆN ÍCH & TRẢI NGHIỆM CHUYÊN NGHIỆP TẠI TỔ BUÔN BADMINTON -->
    <section class="mb-5">
        <div class="row g-4">
            <!-- Feature 1: AI Advisor -->
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="pro-feature-card pro-feature-danger h-100">
                    <div>
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between mb-3">
